The current page has "问题明细" section with columns 编号/产品/步骤/问题/严重度/依据, and suggestions with description `${s.id} · 依据 ${s.basis.join("、")}`.

Per G2, I need:
1. Section title "问题清单", positioned after 链路明细 and before 下一步 (it already is).
2. Columns: 编号 span 1, 位置 span 3 (value "产品 · 第 N 步 · 屏名"), 问题 span 3, 严重度 span 2 tone ["高"]. Sum = 1+3+3+2 = 9. ✓
3. Suggestions: each List item description = detail + "依据:" + basis entries resolved.

Let me build the helper functions.

For 位置: for issue with product 云途, step 4 → find chain product 云途, step no 4 → screen "增值服务" → "云途 · 第 4 步 · 增值服务".

For product "全部": "全部产品 · 第 N 步" then append each product's screen for that step, dedupe. No such issues here but implement anyway.

For basis: item is either an issue id (P1..P7) or a step reference like "飞鱼第 5 步". For issue id: "编号 · 产品 第 N 步 · 屏名" — the format in the guide: 「编号 · 产品 第 N 步 · 屏名」 e.g. "P1 · 云途 第 4 步 · 增值服务". For step reference "远川银行第 2 步" → add screen name after step: "飞鱼第 5 步 · 附加产品".

Let me write the code.

Now suggestions description: `${detail}依据:${...}` — detail is empty here, so description starts with "依据:...". Hmm, guide says "在 `description` 的 `detail` 后接「依据:」". So description = detail + "依据:" + basis joined by ";". Since detail empty, description = "依据:飞鱼第 5 步 · 附加产品;P1 · 云途 第 4 步 · 增值服务;...".

Let me write the helpers.

```tsx
const chainByProduct = (name: string) => chains.find((c: any) => c.product === name)
const screenOf = (product: string, stepNo: number) => {
  const chain = chainByProduct(product)
  const step = chain?.steps.find((s: any) => s.no === stepNo)
  return step?.screen
}

const issueById = (id: string) => issues.find((i: any) => i.id === id)

const issueWhere = (it: any) => {
  if (it.product === "全部") {
    const screens = chains
      .map((c: any) => c.steps.find((s: any) => s.no === it.step)?.screen)
      .filter(Boolean)
      .filter((s, i, arr) => arr.indexOf(s) === i)
    return `全部产品 · 第 ${it.step} 步${screens.length ? " · " + screens.join("、") : ""}`
  }
  const screen = screenOf(it.product, it.step)
  return `${it.product} · 第 ${it.step} 步${screen ? " · " + screen : ""}`
}

const basisText = (b: string) => {
  const hit = issueById(b)
  if (hit) return `${hit.id} · ${hit.product} 第 ${hit.step} 步 · ${screenOf(hit.product, hit.step)}`
  // step reference like "飞鱼第 5 步"
  const m = b.match(/^(.+?)第\s*(\d+)\s*步$/)
  if (m) {
    const screen = screenOf(m[1], Number(m[2]))
    return screen ? `${b} · ${screen}` : b
  }
  return b
}
```

Note the issue where for "全部" — the guide says 屏名相同只写一次; I dedupe.

