<Section title="问题清单" description="按严重度排列的 7 个问题">
  <DataTable
    columns={[
      { key: "id", label: "编号", span: 1 },
      { key: "where", label: "位置", span: 3 },
      { key: "title", label: "问题", span: 3 },
      { key: "severity", label: "严重度", span: 2, tone: ["高"] },
    ]}
    rows={issues.map((i: any) => ({
      id: i.id,
      where: issueWhere(i),
      title: i.title,
      severity: i.severity,
    }))}
  />
</Section>
```

Description: keep original "按严重度排列的 7 个问题" — but issues are not sorted by severity; they're in array order. Maybe change to "按流程顺序排列的 7 个问题". Actually G2 says rows in issues array order. The description should be a sentence about unit/口径 or this section's conclusion. Let me write "7 个问题及定位截图的位置". Keep simple. Actually minimal changes: the original description "按严重度排列的 7 个问题" is inaccurate. I'll change to "7 个问题,按发现顺序排列".

Suggestions:

```tsx
<Section title="下一步" description="基于对比与问题提出的四条改进建议">
  <List
    numbered
    columns={3}
    items={suggestions.map((s: any) => ({
      title: s.title,
      description: `${s.detail ? s.detail + " " : ""}依据:${s.basis.map(basisText).join(";")}`,
    }))}
  />
</Section>
```

Wait, columns={3} with long descriptions might be crowded. The original used columns={3}. The guide says "三条左右、每条一句话:List, columns={3}, numbered, 三列并排". With long 依据 text, three columns might be tight but that's the rule. Keep as is.

